OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's recycling rates at
OL,4,Afive-year low. How is your area doing?
OL,5,
OL,6,FScotland's recycling rate has fallen to
OL,7,Fits lowest level in five years,
OL,8,Faccording to figures from the Scottish
OL,9,FEnvironment Protection Agency (Sepa).
OL,11,FThe Scottish government's environmental
OL,12,Fregulator says households recycled
OL,13,F42.8% of waste in 2025 - down from
OL,14,F44.3% the previous year.
OL,16,FAccording to a roadmap set by the
OL,17,FScottish government in 2010, recycling
OL,18,Frates should have hit 70% last year but
OL,19,Fare falling well short.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
