OL,3,GNEWSAScotland's recycling rates at
OL,4,Afive-year low. How is your area doing?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe share of waste processed at an
OL,7,Fincinerator remained broadly the same
OL,8,Fat 82% but the amount being diverted to
OL,9,Flandfill fell by 10%.
